ose a nonland card from it. That player discards that card.\\nSurveil 1. (Look at the top card of your library. You may put it into your graveyard.)', "Target opponent reveals their hand. You choose a nonland card from that player's graveyard or hand and exile it.", "This spell can't be countered.\\nFlying\\nWhenever you draw a card, Niv-Mizzet, Parun deals 1 damage to any target.\\nWhenever a player casts an instant or sorcery spell, you draw a card.", "This spell can't be countered.\\nInescapable Blaze deals 6 damage to any target.", 'This spell costs {2} less to cast if it targets a legendary creature.\\nDestroy target creature.\\nSurveil 2. (Look at the top two cards of your library, then put any number of them into your graveyard and the rest on top of your library in any order.)', "Trample (This creature can deal excess combat damage to the player or planeswalker it's attacking.)\\nWhenever Ral's Staticaster attacks, if you control a Ral planeswalker, Ral's Staticaster gets +1/+0 for each card in your hand until end of turn.", 'Trample\\nAt the beginning of your upkeep, exile a creature card from your graveyard. If you do, put a +1/+1 counter on Charnel Troll. Otherwise, sacrifice it.\\n{B}{G}, Discard a creature card: Put a +1/+1 counter on Charnel Troll.', 'Trample\\nRampaging Monument enters the battlefield with three +1/+1 counters on it.\\nWhenever you cast a multicolored spell, put a +1/+1 counter on Rampaging Monument.', 'Trample\\nWhenever Book Devourer deals combat damage to a player, you may discard all the cards in your hand. If you do, draw that many cards.', "Trample\\nWhenever you cast an instant or sorcery spell, Erratic Cyclops gets +X/+0 until end of turn, where X is that spell's mana value.", 'Trample\\nWhenever you cast an instant or sorcery spell, Fire Urchin gets +1/+0 until end of turn.', 'Undergrowth — Rhizome Lurcher enters the battlefield with a number of +1/+1 counters on it equal to the number of creature cards in your graveyard.', '