lying and vigilance are created instead.', 'If you would draw a card, instead look at the top three cards of your library, then put one into your hand and the rest into your graveyard.\\nPay 4 life: Underrealm Lich gains indestructible until end of turn. Tap it.', 'Instant and sorcery spells you cast cost {1} less to cast.', 'Izzet Guildgate enters the battlefield tapped.\\n{T}: Add {U} or {R}.', 'Lands you control have "{T}: Add one mana of any color."\\n{T}: Add one mana of any color.', 'Lava Coil deals 4 damage to target creature. If that creature would die this turn, exile it instead.', "Leapfrog has flying as long as you've cast an instant or sorcery spell this turn.", 'Lifelink', 'Lifelink\\nWhen Blood Operative enters the battlefield, you may exile target card from a graveyard.\\nWhenever you surveil, if Blood Operative is in your graveyard, you may pay 3 life. If you do, return Blood Operative to your hand.', "Menace (This creature can't be blocked except by two or more creatures.)", 'Mentor (Whenever this creature attacks, put a +1/+1 counter on target attacking creature with lesser power.)', 'Mentor (Whenever this creature attacks, put a +1/+1 counter on target attacking creature with lesser power.)\\nAt the beginning of combat on your turn, create a 1/1 red Goblin creature token. That token gains haste until end of turn and attacks this combat if able.', 'Mentor (Whenever this creature attacks, put a +1/+1 counter on target attacking creature with lesser power.)\\nWhenever Truefire Captain is dealt damage, it deals that much damage to target player.', "Mentor (Whenever this creature attacks, put a +1/+1 counter on target attacking creature with lesser power.)\\nWojek Bodyguard can't attack or block alone.", 'Mentor (Whenever this creature attacks, put a +1/+1 counter on target attacking creature with lesser power.)\\n{1}{R}: Goblin Banneret gets +2/+0 until end of turn.', 'Mentor (Whenever this creature attacks, put a +1/+1 counter on target attacking creature with lesser power.)\\n{2}{R}{W}: Boros Challenger gets +1/+1 until end of turn.', 'Other creatures you control get +1/+1.\\nWhen Trostani Discordant enters the battlefield, create two 1/1 white Soldier creature tokens with lifelink.\\nAt the beginning of your end step, each player gains control of all creatures they own.', 'Precision Bolt deals 3 damage to any target.', 'Put a +1/+1 counter on each of up to two target creatures.', 'Put a +1/+1 counter on target creature. That creature gains indestructible until end of turn.', 'R', 'Reach', "Reach\\nUndergrowth — When Kraul Harpooner enters the battlefield, choose up to one target creature with flying you don't control. Kraul Harpooner gets +X/+0 until end of turn, where X is the number of creature cards in your graveyard, then you may have Kraul Harpooner fight that creature.", 'Reach\\nUndergrowth — When you cast this spell, reveal the top X cards of your library, where X is the number of creature cards in your graveyard. You may put a green permanent card with converted mana cost X or less from among them onto the battlefield. Put the rest on the bottom of your library in a random order.', 'Response deals 5 damage to target attacking or blocking creature.', "Return X target creatures of the creature type of your choice to their owner's hand.", "Return target creature to its owner's hand. You may search your library and/or graveyard for a card named Ral, Caller of Storms, reveal it, and put it into your hand. If you search your library this way, shuffle it.", "Return target creature to its owner's hand.\\nSurveil 1. (Look at the top card of your library. You may put that card into your graveyard.)", 'Return up to three target multicolored cards from your graveyard to your hand. Exile Vivid Revival.', 'Return up to two target creature cards from your graveyard to your hand.', 'Righteous Blow deals 2 damage to target attacking or blocking creature.', 'Search your library for a basic Forest or Plains card, reveal it, put it into your hand, then shuffle your library.', 'Search your library for up to two basic land cards and/or Gate cards, put them onto the battlefield tapped, then shuffle your library.', 'Selesnya Guildgate enters the battlefield tapped.\\n{T}: Add {G} or {W}.', 'Surveil 2, then choose an instant or sorcery card in your graveyard. You may cast that card this turn. If that card would be put into your graveyard this turn, exile it instead. (To surveil 2, look at the top two cards of your library, then put any number of them into your graveyard and the rest on top of your library in any order.)', 'Surveil 2, then draw a card. (To surveil 2, look at the top two cards of your library, then put any number of them into your graveyard and the rest on top of your library in any order.)', 'Surveil 2, then draw two cards. Notion Rain deals 2 damage to you. (To surveil 2, look at the top two cards of your library, then put any number of them into your graveyard and the rest on top of your library in any order.)', 'Switch the power and toughness of each of up to two target creatures.', "Tap target creature. Sonic Assault deals 2 damage to that creature's controller.\\nJump-start (You may cast this card from your graveyard by discarding a card in addition to paying its other costs. Then exile this card.)", 'Target creature deals damage to itself equal to its power.', 'Target creature gets +1/+1 and gains deathtouch until end of turn.', 'Target creature gets +1/+1 and gains flying until end of turn.\\nJump-start (You may cast this card from your graveyard by discarding a card in addition to paying its other costs. Then exile this card.)', 'Target creature gets +1/+1 and gains haste until end of turn.\\nJump-start (You may cast this card from your graveyard by discarding a card in addition to paying its other costs. Then exile this card.)', 'Target creature gets +1/+1 until end of turn for each creature you control.', 'Target creature gets +2/+2 until end of turn.', 'Target creature gets +2/+2 until end of turn. You gain 1 life for each attacking creature you control.', 'Target creature gets +3/+0 and gains first strike until end of turn.', 'Target creature gets +3/+3 until end of turn.\\nTarget creature gets +3/+3 until end of turn.\\nTarget creature gets +3/+3 until end of turn.', 'Target creature gets -3/-0 until end of turn.\\nSurveil 2. (Look at the top two cards of your library, then put any number of them into your graveyard and the rest on top of your library in any order.)', 'Target creature you control deals damage equal to its power to target player.\\nJump-start (You may cast this card from your graveyard by discarding a card in addition to paying its other costs. Then exile this card.)', "Target creature you control fights target creature you don't control. (Each deals damage equal to its power to the other.)", "Target opponent may have Risk Factor deal 4 damage to them. If that player doesn't, you draw three cards.\\nJump-start (You may cast this card from your graveyard by discarding a card in addition to paying its other costs. Then exile this card.)", 'Target opponent reveals their hand. You choose a nonland card from it. That player discards that card.\\nSurveil 1. (Look at the top card of your library. You may put it into your graveyard.)', "Target opponent reveals their hand. You choose a nonland card from that player's graveyard or hand and exile it.", "This spell can't be countered.\\nFlying\\nWhenever you draw a card, Niv-Mizzet, Parun deals 1 damage to any target.\\nWhenever a player casts an instant or sorcery spell, you draw a card.", "This spell can't be countered.\\nInescapable Blaze deals 6 damage to any target.", 'This spell costs {2} less to cast if it targets a legendary creature.\\nDestroy target creature.\\nSurveil 2. (Look at the top two cards of your library, then put any number of them into your graveyard and the rest on top of your library in any order.)', "Trample (This creature can deal excess combat damage to the player or planeswalker it's attacking.)\\nWhenever Ral's Staticaster attacks, if you control a Ral planeswalker, Ral's Staticaster gets +1/+0 for each card in your hand until end of turn.", 'Trample\\nAt the beginning of your upkeep, exile a creature card from your graveyard. If you do, put a +1/+1 counter on Charnel Troll. Otherwise, sacrifice it.\\n{B}{G}, Discard a creature card: Put a +1/+1 counter on Charnel Troll.', 'Trample\\nRampaging Monument enters the battlefield with three +1/+1 counters on it.\\nWhenever you cast a multicolored spell, put a +1/+1 counter on Rampaging Monument.', 'Trample\\nWhenever Book Devourer deals combat damage to a player, you may discard all the cards in your hand. If you do, draw that many cards.', "Trample\\nWhenever you cast an instant or sorcery spell, Erratic Cyclops gets +X/+0 until end of turn, where X is that spell's converted mana cost.", 'Trample\\nWhenever you cast an instant or sorcery spell, Fire Urchin gets +1/+0 until end of turn.', 'U', 'Undergrowth — Rhizome Lurcher enters the battlefield with a number of +1/+1 counters on it equal to the number of creature cards in your graveyard.', 'Undergrowth — Search your library for a black card with converted mana cost less than or equal to the number of creature cards in your graveyard, reveal it, put it into your hand, then shuffle your library.', 'Undergrowth — Target creature gets -X/-X until end of turn, where X is the number of creature cards in your graveyard. If that creature would die this turn, exile it instead.', 'Undergrowth — This spell costs {1} less to cast for each creature card in your graveyard.\\nWhen Molderhulk enters the battlefield, return target land card from your graveyard to the battlefield.', 'Undergrowth — When Izoni, Thousand-Eyed enters the battlefield, create a 1/1 black and green Insect creature token for each creature card in your graveyard.\\n{B}{G}, Sacrifice another creature: You gain 1 life and draw a card.', 'Undergrowth — When Kraul Foragers enters the battlefield, you gain 1 life for each creature card in your graveyard.', 'Undergrowth — When Lotleth Giant enters the battlefield, it deals 1 damage to target opponent for each creature card in your graveyard.', "Undergrowth — When Moodmark Painter enters the battlefield, target creature gains menace and gets +X/+0 until end of turn, where X is the number of creature cards in your graveyard. (It can't be blocked except by two or more creatures.)", "Undergrowth — When Vigorspore Wurm enters the battlefield, target creature gains vigilance and gets +X/+X until end of turn, where X is the number of creature cards in your graveyard.\\nVigorspore Wurm can't be blocked by more than one creature.", 'Untap all creatures you control. They gain hexproof and indestructible until end of turn. (They can\'t be the targets of spells or abilities your opponents control. Damage and effects that say "destroy" don\'t destroy them.)', 'Vicious Rumors deals 1 damage to each opponent. Each opponent discards a card, then puts the top card of their library into their graveyard. You gain 1 life.', 'Vigilance', 'Vigilance\\nWhen Conclave Cavalier dies, create two 2/2 green and white Elf Knight creature tokens with vigilance.', 'Vigilance\\nWhen Intrusive Packbeast enters the battlefield, tap up to two target creatures your opponents control.', 'Vigilance\\nWhenever Swathcutter Giant attacks, it deals 1 damage to each creature defending player controls.', "Vigilance\\n{T}, Sacrifice Bounty Agent: Destroy target legendary permanent that's an artifact, creature, or enchantment.", 'W', "When Affectionate Indrik enters the battlefield, you may have it fight target creature you don't control. (Each deals damage equal to its power to the other.)", "When Attendant of Vraska dies, if you control a Vraska planeswalker, you gain life equal to Attendant of Vraska's power.", 'When Burglar Rat enters the battlefield, each opponent discards a card.', 'When Centaur Peacemaker enters the battlefield, each player gains 4 life.', 'When Dimir Informant enters the battlefield, surveil 2. (Look at the top two cards of your library, then put any number of them into your graveyard and the rest on top of your library in any order.)', "When Disinformation Campaign enters the battlefield, you draw a card and each opponent discards a card.\\nWhenever you surveil, return Disinformation Campaign to its owner's hand.", 'When District Guide enters the battlefield, you may search your library for a basic land card or Gate card, reveal it, put it into your hand, then shuffle your library.', 'When Generous Stray enters the battlefield, draw a card.', 'When Glowspore Shaman enters the battlefield, put the top three cards of your library into your graveyard. You may put a land card from your graveyard on top of your library.', 'When Golgari Findbroker enters the battlefield, return target permanent card from your graveyard to your hand.', 'When Guild Summit enters the battlefield, you may tap any number of untapped Gates you control. Draw a card for each Gate tapped this way.\\nWhenever a Gate enters the battlefield under your control, draw a card.', 'When Hunted Witness dies, create a 1/1 white Soldier creature token with lifelink.', 'When Ironshell Beetle enters the battlefield, put a +1/+1 counter on target creature.', 'When Knight of Autumn enters the battlefield, choose one —\\n• Put two +1/+1 counters on Knight of Autumn.\\n• Destroy target artifact or enchantment.\\n• You gain 4 life.', "When Lazav, the Multifarious enters the battlefield, surveil 1. (Look at the top card of your library. You may put it into your graveyard.)\\n{X}: Lazav, the Multifarious becomes a copy of target creature card in your graveyard with converted mana cost X, except its name is Lazav, the Multifarious, it's legendary in addition to its other types, and it has this ability.", "When Plaguecrafter enters the battlefield, each player sacrifices a creature or planeswalker. Each player who can't discards a card.", 'When Rubblebelt Boar enters the battlefield, target creature gets +2/+0 until end of turn.', 'When Spinal Centipede dies, put a +1/+1 counter on target creature you control.', 'When Sumala Woodshaper enters the battlefield, look at the top four cards of your library. You may reveal a creature or enchantment card from among them and put it into your hand. Put the rest on the bottom of your library in a random order.', 'When Tenth District Guard enters the battlefield, target creature gets +0/+1 until end of turn.', 'Whenever Emmara, Soul of the Accord becomes tapped, create a 1/1 white Soldier creature token with lifelink.', "Whenever Goblin Locksmith attacks, creatures with defender can't block this turn.", 'Whenever Haazda Marshal and at least two other creatures attack, create a 1/1 white Soldier creature token with lifelink.', 'Whenever Inspiring Unicorn attacks, creatures you control get +1/+1 until end of turn.', 'Whenever Ledev Champion attacks, you may tap any number of untapped creatures you control. Ledev Champion gets +1/+1 until end of turn for each creature tapped this way.\\n{3}{G}{W}: Create a 1/1 white Soldier creature token with lifelink.', 'Whenever Ornery Goblin blocks or becomes blocked by a creature, Ornery Goblin deals 1 damage to that creature.', 'Whenever Skyline Scout attacks, you may pay {1}{W}. If you do, it gains flying until end of turn.', 'Whenever Vedalken Mesmerist attacks, target creature an opponent controls gets -2/-0 until end of turn.', 'Whenever a nontoken creature you control dies, Midnight Reaper deals 1 damage to you and you draw a card.', "Whenever another creature you control enters the battlefield or dies, if that creature's power is greater than Pelt Collector's, put a +1/+1 counter on Pelt Collector.\\nAs long as Pelt Collector has three or more +1/+1 counters on it, it has trample.", 'Whenever you cast a blue spell, target player puts the top two cards of their library into their graveyard.', 'Whenever you cast a creature spell, draw a card.', 'Whenever you cast a red spell, if Runaway Steam-Kin has fewer than three +1/+1 counters on it, put a +1/+1 counter on Runaway Steam-Kin.\\nRemove three +1/+1 counters from Runaway Steam-Kin: Add {R}{R}{R}.', 'Whenever you cast an instant or sorcery spell that targets only Beamsplitter Mage, if you control one or more other creatures that spell could target, choose one of those creatures. Copy that spell. The copy targets the chosen creature.', "Whenever you cast an instant or sorcery spell, copy it for each other instant and sorcery spell you've cast before it this turn. You may choose new targets for the copies.", 'Whenever you cast an instant or sorcery spell, create a 1/1 blue Bird Illusion creature token with flying.', "Whenever you cast an instant or sorcery spell, put a charge counter on Firemind's Research.\\n{1}{U}, Remove two charge counters from Firemind's Research: Draw a card.\\n{1}{R}, Remove five charge counters from Firemind's Research: It deals 5 damage to any target.", "Whenever you cast an instant or sorcery spell, target creature an opponent controls can't block this turn.", 'Whenever you gain life, you may pay {2}. If you do, draw a card.\\n{3}{W}: Create a 1/1 white Soldier creature token with lifelink.', 'Whenever you surveil for the first time each turn, Whispering Snitch deals 1 damage to each opponent and you gain 1 life.', 'You gain X life and draw X cards, where X is the number of creatures you control. Creatures you control get +1/+1 until end of turn.', 'You may look at an additional two cards each time you surveil.\\nExile Enhanced Surveillance: Shuffle your graveyard into your library.', "You may look at the top card of your library any time.\\nYou may play the top card of your library.\\nYou can't play cards from your hand.\\n{3}{R}: Destroy Experimental Frenzy.", '{1}, Sacrifice Goblin Cratermaker: Choose one —\\n• Goblin Cratermaker deals 2 damage to target creature.\\n• Destroy target colorless nonland permanent.', "{1}, Sacrifice another creature: Put a +1/+1 counter on Undercity Necrolisk. It gains menace until end of turn. Activate this ability only any time you could cast a sorcery. (It can't be blocked except by two or more creatures.)", '{1}{B}: Veiled Shade gets +1/+1 until end of turn.', "{1}{U}, {T}: Target creature doesn't untap during its controller's next untap step.\\n{2}{B}, {T}: Surveil 2. (Look at the top two cards of your library, then put any number of them into your graveyard and the rest on top of your library in any order.)", '{2}{U}, {T}: You may cast an instant or sorcery card from your hand without paying its mana cost.', "{2}{U}: Target creature can't be blocked this turn.", '{3}{U}, {T}: Draw a card.\\n{X}{R}, {T}: Copy target instant or sorcery spell you control with converted mana cost X. You may choose new targets for the copy.', '{4}, {T}, Sacrifice Silent Dart: It deals 3 damage to target creature.', "{4}{B}, {T}: Creatures you control get +1/+0 and gain menace until end of turn. (They can't be blocked except by two or more creatures.)\\n{1}{G}, {T}: You gain 2 life.", '{4}{G}: Devkarin Dissident gets +2/+2 until end of turn.', '{5}{R}, {T}: Legion Guildmage deals 3 damage to each opponent.\\n{2}{W}, {T}: Tap another target creature.', '{G}, {T}: Creatures you control gain trample until end of turn.\\n{5}{W}, {T}: Create a 2/2 green and white Elf Knight creature token with vigilance.', '{T}: Add {B} or {G}.\\n{BG}{BG}{BG}{BG}, {T}, Sacrifice Golgari Locket: Draw two cards.', '{T}: Add {C}.\\n{1}, {T}: Add one mana of any color. If that mana is spent on a multicolored creature spell, that creature enters the battlefield with an additional +1/+1 counter on it.', '{T}: Add {G} or {W}.\\n{RW}{RW}{RW}{RW}, {T}, Sacrifice Selesnya Locket: Draw two cards.', '{T}: Add {R} or {W}.\\n{GU}{GU}{GU}{GU}, {T}, Sacrifice Boros Locket: Draw two cards.', '{T}: Add {U} or {B}.\\n{UB}{UB}{UB}{UB}, {T}, Sacrifice Dimir Locket: Draw two cards.', '{T}: Add {U} or {R}.\\n{UR}{UR}{UR}{UR}, {T}, Sacrifice Izzet Locket: Draw two cards.', '{T}: Put the top card of your library into your graveyard.\\n{2}, {T}, Exile Wand of Vertebrae: Shuffle up to five target cards from your graveyard into your library.']
